  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Centipede Shroud — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Starting at 6th level, as an action you can spend 3 CE to force all creatures within 30 feet to make a Strength saving throw if they are on the ground. On a failure, they take 6d6 bludgeoning damage and fall prone. On a success, they take half as much damage. If your cursed centipede is summoned, you can instead do this as a bonus action. This damage increases to 10d6 at 11th and 14d6 at 18th level.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you gain 5 stat points you can spend to increase your centipede’s ability scores (max of 22). You can now add your proficiency bonus to any saving throw or skill check it makes.<br />\nYou gain 5 additional stat points at 11th level.</p>",
